WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Make Work OS yours. Find your profile, display and workday settings.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.167
Open Settings. Choose Settings from the sidebar footer.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.667
Explore the settings groups. Profile, this device, workday, guides and memory.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.067
Change what you need. Appearance preferences stay on this device.

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.267
Your workspace, your way. Settings explains what is synced and what stays local.
